  "$note": "An original RIVAL to herobot-classic, built on the same principles and to the same degree of adornment: the herobot proportions, the lead anime face in the same face-window helm (white frame and trim where the hero's is cyan, a blue diamond gem, two pointed horns sweeping up and back off the temples, a wild blond ponytail out of the helm's back), a dark bodysuit under red armour, and a more ANGULAR silhouette: the volumes cut to eight flat facets (forearms, boots, collar, thigh rims, soles), faceted knee spikes, and angular plate pauldrons over darker round shoulder balls. Chest, pec plates, ab plaque and briefs as on the hero.",
